  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1401.01 Purpose",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-04-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1401.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to implement RSA 485-H as to municipalities and certain public water systems by establishing criteria and procedures for administering the per and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS) remediation loan fund (PFAS RLF) program to assist with the cost of complying with state maximum contaminant levels (MCLs) for PFAS as established in RSA 485:16-e.\n\nSource. #13164, eff 1-26-21, ss by #13289, INTERIM, eff 10-30-21, EXPIRES: 4-28-22; ss by #13372, eff 4-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1400.html"
}
